<title>USA: Rimage to cut seven percent of work-force.</title>
<headline>Rimage to cut seven percent of work-force.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rimage Corp said Thursday it will cut about seven percent of its work-force, or 17 people, primarily due to a shift in information recording industry trends to CD-ROM and CD-Recordable from diskette and tape.</p>
<p>The company said it does not expect a material charge on earnings from the cuts.  </p>
<p>The cuts were made across all areas at the company's headquarters and were effective late Wednesday, Rimage said.</p>
<p>Rimage shares were unchanged at four Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
